PII Shield

This product includes detection patterns, JSON key lists and test log lines adapted from
logtotal-sanitizer by SOC Prime (https://github.com/socprime/logtotal-sanitizer),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

The adapted material is in these files:
  github-repo-template/rules/secrets.yaml
  github-repo-template/rules/identity.yaml
  github-repo-template/rules/hosts.yaml
  github-repo-template/rules/json_fields.yaml
  tests/test_core.py (EngineTests.LOG_CASES and the JSON and benign log tests)

The patterns were rewritten for Python regular expressions and the PII Shield rule format.
